%% Current state. Source: infra/lib/stacks/verification-stack.ts. Verified 2026-09-13.
sequenceDiagram
    participant SM as StateMachine
    participant PE as PrepareEvidence
    participant ADJ as Adjudicate
    participant SR as StoreResult
    participant VV as CheckVEVO
    participant AC as SubmitToACIC
    participant PO as PollACIC
    participant HT as HandleACICTimeout
    participant SAR as StoreACICResult
    participant MR as MergeResults
    participant DG as CheckDisputeGate
    participant OW as OpenDisputeWindow
    participant GC as GeneratePoliceCert
    participant GVC as GenerateVevoCert
    participant SN as SendNotification
    participant ER as HandleError

    alt resume_after_manual_review == true
        SM->>SM: RouteStart → ResumeExternalChecks → VevoGate
    else default
        SM->>PE: invoke
        Note over PE: Rekognition CompareFaces + DetectFaces<br/>Name-chain verify, Tier check
    end

    SM->>ADJ: invoke (documents + selfie + prompt)
    Note over ADJ: Bedrock Claude Sonnet 4.6 vision<br/>guardrail and enforced formatter tool<br/>max 4096 tokens and 90s call timeout
    Note over ADJ: Malformed output retries primary up to 3 times<br/>then validates and invokes fallback profile on failure

    SM->>SR: invoke
    Note over SR: Write result to DynamoDB

    alt final_status == OK
        alt vevo_requested + vevo_consent_given
            SM->>VV: invoke
            Note over VV: SOAP DHA VEVO<br/>Work entitlement check

            alt VEVO ERROR / UNAVAILABLE
                Note over SM: VevoErrorGate<br/>final_status=NEEDS_REVIEW, vevo_error=true
                SM->>SN: HandleVevoError → SendNotification
                Note over SN: Updates DynamoDB state<br/>to MANUAL_REVIEW
                Note over SM: Exit, skip ACIC
            else SUCCEEDED / NOT_APPLICABLE
                Note over SM: Always continue to ACIC<br/>regardless of VEVO result
            end
        else
            Note over SM: VevoSkipped (Parameters+JsonMerge)<br/>vevo_check=NOT_APPLICABLE<br/>preserves existing payload
        end

        opt VEVO succeeded (or not requested)
            SM->>AC: invoke
            Note over AC: SOAP ACIC NSS<br/>SubmitCheckRequest

            Note over SM: Wait 30s(sandbox)/60m(prod)

            loop 10s sandbox / 24h prod, max 90 days
                SM->>PO: invoke
                Note over PO: SOAP GetResultRequest

                alt NDCO / DCO
                    SM->>SAR: invoke
                    Note over SM: Exit polling loop
                else elapsed_days >= 90
                    SM->>HT: invoke
                    Note over HT: Set ACIC_TIMEOUT state<br/>Emit TimeoutCount metric
                    Note over SM: Exit polling loop
                else POLLFAILED/REFERRED
                    Note over SM: Wait 10s(sandbox)/24h(prod)<br/>retry
                end
            end

            SM->>MR: MergeResults
            Note over MR: Pass-through (no-op)<br/>Sequential flow has no parallel_results<br/>Data already in event payload

            SM->>DG: CheckDisputeGate

            alt ACIC DCO
                SM->>OW: invoke
                Note over OW: Open 48h dispute window<br/>email applicant result detail<br/>NO certificate, NO employer/third-party delivery
                Note over SM: SFN ends here for DCO<br/>close-dispute-window finalises later
            else NDCO / non-DCO
                SM->>GC: invoke
                Note over GC: Generate police check PDF<br/>prefix P when applicable
                SM->>GVC: invoke
                Note over GVC: Generate VEVO certificate PDF<br/>prefix V, requires VEVO SUCCEEDED
            end
        end

    else NEEDS_REVIEW
        Note over SM: Skip ACIC/VEVO<br/>Send notification directly
    end

    opt NDCO / non-DCO immediate finalisation
        SM->>SN: invoke
        Note over SN: Email police check + VEVO<br/>certificate PDFs via SES<br/>SMS via SNS
    end

    rect rgb(200, 40, 40)
        Note over SM,ER: Global Catch: States.ALL on every task
        ER-->>SM: Error handler invoked
        Note over ER: Log error to CloudWatch<br/>Update app state to ERROR<br/>Notify ops via SNS
    end
